# POS Business Rules

- Currency is PKR (Pakistani Rupee).
- Tax is disabled and zero by default in the MVP. Do not add tax to totals.
- Customers and expenses are included in the MVP.
- A successful sale reduces stock once. A retry or a second save must not reduce it again.
- Received stock is added once. A retry must not add the same receipt again.
- Payment and total math must match the line items. Do not round or drop an amount in a way that changes the balance due.
- MVP receipts are digital only. Barcode scanning and receipt printing are deferred to a later phase.
